  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Nothing Good Can Come of This is an arcade game that appears at Magfest every year. It always proves to be very popular. After speaking to the creator, he agreed it would be great to port it to the NES. This is that game. Get the gun, get the bullet, and shoot the other player before he shoots you. Easy, right?"
    }
